OL,3,ALena Dunham's Girls to return for
OL,4,Alimited HBO run
OL,5,
OL,6,FHBO's award-winning show Girls will
OL,7,Freturn to screens for a limited run ten
OL,8,Fyears after the series finale aired.
OL,10,FLena Dunham ` the show's creator,
OL,11,Fwriter, and one of its stars ` shared
OL,12,Fthe announcement in a mock zoom call
OL,13,Fwith members of the original cast
OL,14,FAllison Williams, Jemima Kirke, Zosia
OL,15,FMamet and Andrew Rannells.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
